  "bodyText": "Skip to content\n\nSave 15% on orders over $50 ♡ Use code 15OFF at checkout\n\nSkin Care\nHair Care\nBody Care\nNail Polish\nBlog\nAbout Us\nCart\nAbout Us\n\nBKIND is a Montreal-based brand that finds its roots in the consciousness of everything surrounding us. This value combined with our passion for natural skincare makes of BKIND a company that offers natural products that are effective and of high quality.\n\n\"Our mission is to promote the power of plants through high quality body products, made from natural ingredients and with respect for everything around us.\"\n\nMarilyne, Founder\n\nMeet Marilyne, BKIND Founder\n\nMarilyne, who holds a master's degree in microbiology, has been developing her own cosmetics for years. \n\nBecause of her very sensitive skin, she found that the products available in pharmacies and large stores didn’t suit her. This led her to try natural ingredients, and she quickly realized the power of them on her skin.\n\nBKIND was born in 2014 and is the result of the combination of Marilyne’s interest in natural cosmetics and expertise in microbiology. \n\nOur Store\n\nWe opened our first store in 2017 in the Old port of Montreal. Here, we started offering packaging-free and bulk products, and we could welcome our customers in person for the first time.\n\nIn August 2019, we opened a new boutique on Saint-Laurent Boulevard, in Montreal. This is where our ideas are drawn from, where our projects come to life and where our team is ready to give you personalized advice on all our products. We can’t wait to see you!\n\nContact us\n\nHave a question or comment? Enter your details and we’ll be happy to get back to you.\n\nName\nEmail *\nPhone number\nComment\nSend\nGet 20% off your first order\n\nJoin our email list for exclusive offers and the latest news.\n\nEmail\nMenu\nSkin Care\nHair Care\nBody Care\nNail Polish\nBlog\nAbout Us\nOur Store\n\n3455 St Laurent Blvd\nMontreal, Quebec H2X 2T6\nMon - Fri 9 a.m. - 7 p.m.\nSat - Sun 10a.m. - 6p.m.\n\n\nOur Promise\n\nTo create high quality, plant-based products that are safe for people and the planet.\n\nTwitter\nFacebook\nPinterest\nInstagram\nTikTok\n© 2026, theme-sense-demo Powered by Shopify"
}